<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES EDGE SHADE HIGHER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES EDGE SHADE HIGHER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were a</p>
<p>shade higher at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate rose one basis point to 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			   April 28 fix	   April 25 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	    3.01 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	    3.05 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	    3.08 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	    3.21 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	    3.32 pct		3.31 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	   3.44 pct		3.44 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
